{"id":"7cb391918869c9ba","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-equivalent.md","title":"Equivalent Consequence Relations","display":"df-equivalent — Equivalent Consequence Relations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-equivalent","aliases":["93-df-equivalent"],"display":"df-equivalent — Equivalent Consequence Relations","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equivalent — Equivalent Consequence Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2\">\\(\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2\\)</span> are logic-pair candidates; their common formula set and consequence relations are bound in the assertion.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the type-indexed logic predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqConseq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqConseq}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash \\mathrm{EqConseq}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_1\\;\\exists\\vdash_2\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L_1=\\langle F,\\vdash_1\\rangle\\land\\mathcal L_2=\\langle F,\\vdash_2\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash_1)\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash_1\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_2\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash \\mathrm{EqConseq}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_1\\;\\exists\\vdash_2\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L_1=\\langle F,\\vdash_1\\rangle\\land\\mathcal L_2=\\langle F,\\vdash_2\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash_1)\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash_1\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_2\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalence here is equality of the two consequence relations on one formula universe with one common connective type. Equality of separately chosen model classes is neither required nor sufficient without a fixed semantic presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}$ is the type-indexed logic predicate of [[93-df-logic]], and $\\mathrm{EqConseq}_{93}$ is defined here.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqConseq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash \\mathrm{EqConseq}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_1\\;\\exists\\vdash_2\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L_1=\\langle F,\\vdash_1\\rangle\\land\\mathcal L_2=\\langle F,\\vdash_2\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash_1)\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash_2)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash_1\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_2\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[{"id":"173103b981643051","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["c2ca1af9af149e69","bd7e4207897c8db3","afd7605d365be7b6"]}